### ⚠️ Requires [Sync](https://modrinth.com/mod/sync) to be installed! ⚠️

## Holder Condition

---


[Item Condition Types](https://0vergrown.github.io/Sync-Documentation-Website/?file=item_conditions/holder_condition)

Checks whether the entity holding this item stack meets a given [Entity Condition](https://0vergrown.github.io/Sync-Documentation-Website/?file=item_conditions/holder_condition). If the item stack has no holder, the condition returns `false`.

Type ID: `sync:holder_condition`

---

### Examples
```json
{
  "type": "sync:holder_condition",
  "condition": {
    "type": "apoli:entity_type",
    "entity_type": "minecraft:player"
  }
}
```
Check if the holder is a player.
```json
{
  "type": "sync:holder_condition",
  "condition": {
    "type": "apoli:sneaking"
  }
}
```
Check if the holder is sneaking.
```json
{
  "type": "sync:holder_condition"
}
```
Check if the stack is being held at all.

